                type: 'paragraph',
                text: 'Ce Deng (æ–œé’‰) is a Chinese domino game where tiles are laid with adjacent ends matching, similar to Western domino layout. Uses Chinese domino set (32 tiles; 21 unique, 11 duplicated). Best for four players; winner has fewest pips on discarded and unplayed tiles.',
